%%% note
由来: https://docs.mulesoft.com/dataweave/2.11/dw-values-functions-attr (関数ページ)
doc と相違 (doc の Output と実 DW の出力の値が一致しない)
doc の Output:
  {
     "kind": "Attribute",
     "namespace": "http://acme.com/foo",
     "selector": "myAttr"
   }
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/json
import * from dw::util::Values
ns ns0 http://acme.com/fo
---
attr(ns0 , "myAttr")
%%% output application/json
{
  "kind": "Attribute",
  "namespace": "http://acme.com/fo",
  "selector": "myAttr"
}
